start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {2dc [2ch 3dc]x3 2ch}@ring ss@top 2ss ss@sp
R2: 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same [ch {3dc 2ch 3dc}@sp]x3 ch ss@top 2ss ss@sp
R3: 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch 3dc@sp ch [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner ch 3dc@sp ch]x3 ss@top 2ss ss@sp # "ch 1 in next ch-1 sp" read as ch 1 over the side
R4: 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch [3dc@sp ch]x2 [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner ch [3dc@sp ch]x2]x3 ss@top 2ss ss@sp
R5: 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch [3dc@sp ch]x3 [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner ch [3dc@sp ch]x3]x3 ss@top 2ss ss@sp
R6: 3ch=dc {2dc 2ch 3dc}@same ch [3dc@sp ch]x4 [{3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner ch [3dc@sp ch]x4]x3 ss@top 2ss ss@sp fo
